:: thoughts/protag-house-first [thought]
Three days since the sirens stopped.
Nobody came for us. Nobody is coming.
Whoever is left out there — that part falls to me now.

:: thoughts/protag-house-flashlight [thought]
Dad never let this flashlight's batteries die.
Neither will I.

:: thoughts/protag-house-ambient [thought]
Home. Or what is left of the word.
